We collect information directly from you when you provide it, as well as automatically when you use the Application.

A. Information You Provide directly
Account Information: When you register an account, we collect your email address and authentication details (e.g., password credentials).

User-Generated Content: Any profile information, meal descriptions, ranks, or reviews you create, submit, or upload within the Application.

B. Information Collected Automatically
When you connect to or interact with the Application, our infrastructure automatically collects standard technical logs:

IP Address: Collected automatically during network requests to our servers and API endpoints for routing, security, and rate-limiting purposes.

Database & User Identifiers: Unique identifiers assigned to your account, such as your internal database UUID (User ID), session keys, and database record IDs.

Cookies, Local Storage & Auth Tokens: The Application utilizes persistent session tokens (such as JSON Web Tokens or JWTs), refresh tokens, and local device storage keys to keep you securely signed in and to remember your preferences across sessions.

Device & Usage Telemetry: Basic device diagnostics, operating system version, and HTTP User-Agent headers sent during API requests.

