To operate the Application, we rely on third-party cloud infrastructure and service providers who process data on our behalf under strict data protection standards.

Use of Supabase
We use Supabase, Inc. for backend cloud hosting, user authentication, database management, and file storage.

Data Handled by Supabase: Your registered email address, hashed credentials, internal database IDs (UUIDs), user-generated content, IP addresses associated with API calls, and temporary session tokens (JWTs) are stored and processed on Supabase's hosted infrastructure.

Security & Location: Data managed by Supabase is encrypted in transit (TLS/HTTPS) and at rest (AES-256). Data is hosted in secure data center environments.

Third-Party Policy: For more information on how Supabase manages data and infrastructure security, please visit Supabase's Privacy Policy.

